          <row>
            <entry><guilabel>OptimalityTolerance</guilabel></entry>

            <entry><para>Tolerance on the infinity norm of the Lagrangian gradient in solver-variable coordinates. The gradient is compared with OptimalityTolerance, and feasibility is checked using FeasibilityTolerance. Normalize coordinates and the objective consistently before choosing a common gradient threshold.</para> <variablelist>
                <varlistentry>
